        "id": 8397,
        "name": "International Karate +",
        "summary": "Call it a sequel... And you'll land up flat on your back.\n\nThey called International Karate \"the greatest Karate beat' em up yet\" (Commodore User). And who are we to argue? But Archer Maclean has come up with a stunner: A third fighter. An amazing animated background. New moves (including double head-kick and a spectacular backflip). Re-mixed music by Rob Hubbard. And Balls!",
